                <p class="text-base-600 text-sm">Patricia matches her teaching pace to each child's development — physical, cognitive, and emotional. She will never push a student into an exam prematurely, nor hold back one who is ready to advance. For Tengah families, the convenience of a local studio means that even children who need more frequent or slightly longer lessons can be accommodated without logistical strain, ensuring every student gets exactly what they need.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
